/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Woof.... this addition does make this whole window a bit more convoluted / complex and almost calls for a redesign of the whole thing. I'm not sure the 'Export Template Manager' is the first place people would look to download debug symbols. Export Template and Debug Symbol Manager doesn't roll of the tongue quite as nicely 😅 Will have to think a bit about how we could smoothen this out without introducing a redesign... but here's some feedback anyway.\n\n- We need to decide whether we want users to download debug symbols by default or not. Because if we do, then I would not make new categories of these debug symbols and just put them under the category of their architecture. This would keep the list a lot cleaner and conceptually more accurate.\n- Toggling Show Debug Symbols while things are selected is currently finicky. In its current state, disabling 'show debug symbols' should also deselect the debug symbol items so that you can't have the indeterminate state of a parent item while no visible items are selected. Even better would be if disabled checkbox items exist, eg. a greyed-out item with a greyed-out checkbox (in any state) making it clear it's taken out of the equation.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124440#pullrequestreview-5596506463","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124440","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124440#pullrequestreview-5596506463"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124440"}},"submitted_at":"2026-10-21T07:48:58Z","commit_id":"451cbb60b3df745ad9cb4fed82f09ff2323c5f61"}]